-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
flowwrench huginn (formerly huginn-scenario-kit)

Reads the Huginn scenario export format. Huginn is Copyright (c) 2013 Andrew
Cantino (Iteration Labs, LLC), MIT-licensed. No Huginn implementation code is
included. Uses PyYAML (MIT; Copyright (c) 2017-2021 Ingy döt Net,
