flowwrench ha-diff (formerly ha-trace-diff, MIT)

Originally released under the MIT license; its notice is kept in
licenses/ha-trace-diff-MIT.txt. Reads the Home Assistant automation/script trace
download format; no Home Assistant code is included. Uses DeepDiff (MIT),
orderly-set (MIT) and python-json-pointer (BSD-3-Clause) as separately installed
dependencies (the `ha` extra); their license texts are in licenses/. Test
fixtures from Home Assistant Core (Apache-2.0) and Home Assistant Automation
Testkit (GPL-3.0) are test/example data only and keep their own licenses, which
accompany them in tests/ha_diff/fixtures/ and examples/ha-diff/.
